## What I did

I made an acyclic chain of templates. Each level calls the next template at two distinct closed `Path` arguments. The complete depth-15 file is 1,116 bytes:

```bend
import Base

type Path is Data:
  Root{}
  L{p: Path}
  R{p: Path}

def f15(~p: Path) -> Unit:
  Unit{}

def f14(~p: Path) -> Unit:
  a b = f15(~L{p}) f15(~R{p})
  Unit{}

def f13(~p: Path) -> Unit:
  a b = f14(~L{p}) f14(~R{p})
  Unit{}

def f12(~p: Path) -> Unit:
  a b = f13(~L{p}) f13(~R{p})
  Unit{}

def f11(~p: Path) -> Unit:
